      "created_at": "2014-01-17T18:15:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the light of the latest announcement concerning the delay to GSF to add yet more awesome to it, some people who combined both may now want them separated. As I appear to have far more money than sense, I'm offering to pay for the shipping of 5 non-American people who wish to uncombine their orders. Let me know, either in a PM or this thread, the name you used on the Kickstarter before 9pm GMT Sunday and I'll cover the shipping cost.</p><p>Those who accepted an earlier offer to pay for Vengeance shipping are not included in that 5. If you PM me before the deadline, you're covered anyway.</p>",
